WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.300
Not by chance — by formation.

00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:05.600
Here, character is forged
in community.

00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:08.450
Excellence is expected,
not optional.

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:11.350
Faith is lived,
not merely taught.

00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:16.100
Class of 2031 —
you do not arrive as strangers.

00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:19.550
You arrive as the next chapter
of a proven tradition.

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:24.700
It's a place that has already

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:26.700
done this important work
for generations.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:28.650
Welcome home.

